<p>NOTE - AvtoVAZ includes Lada, Niva and Samara brands. Daewoo FSO includes Polonez brand. Daewoo Motor Polska includes Lublin and Zuk brands. Daimler-Benz includes Mercedes-Benz brand. Fiat Others includes Autobianchi, Ferrari, Innocenti and Maserati brands. Fuji includes Subaru brand. General Motors Others includes Cadillac, Chevrolet and Pontiac brands. Gorkovsky Avtomobilny Zavod or GAZ includes Gazelle and Volga brands. Moskvich (formerly AZLK) includes Aleko and Moskvich brands. Perusahaan includes Proton brand.</p>
